TT-Wavelet

TT-Wavelet uses lifting factorizations derived from
Lifting Factorization of PyWavelets filter banks:
https://github.com/draklowell/lifting-factorization

The derived lifting decompositions originate from that project; TT-Wavelet
does not embed its Python/SageMath factorization pipeline.
The project's MIT license and copyright notice are preserved verbatim in
licenses/lifting-factorization-LICENSE.

TT-Metal / TTNN provenance and third-party notices are preserved in
licenses/TT-Metal-LICENSE and licenses/TT-Metal-NOTICE.
